{
  "bookId": "activity-snippets-zhounianqingqiandao",
  "id": "section-22406",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22406001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "「致所有物」",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "啧，不要紧张。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "今天，我保证不会动你的……任何一个小玩意儿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "如果拆掉她们会让你伤心的话，我保证，一根汗毛都不会碰——阿抱歉我忘了，她们没有汗毛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "今天是个特别的日子，对你，对我，对她们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "是时候让那些不自量力的小东西知道，你和我的关系了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "——我亲爱的，「所有物」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "对我来说，只有你是特别的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "无论现在，还是将来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "阿，你可能不喜欢我说话的态度，没关系，\n相信不久之后，你就会习惯了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "接下来，一起找点乐子怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22406012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "很刺激那种。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
